WEBVTT

00:03.570 --> 00:04.471
Wow!

00:04.471 --> 00:07.640
He's good-looking isn't he? I took
his picture with my cellular phone.

00:07.640 --> 00:09.109
Really? You think he's good looking?

00:09.109 --> 00:12.012
Then what kind of guy
is your type, Nina?

00:12.012 --> 00:14.481
You've seemed to be
indifferent the whole time.

00:14.481 --> 00:15.448
Me?

00:15.448 --> 00:18.985
I like a guy who's strong,
sweet, and good-looking

00:18.985 --> 00:22.522
and would try really hard to protect me!

00:22.522 --> 00:23.614
- What?!
- What?!

00:26.893 --> 00:28.328
Waaah!

00:28.328 --> 00:34.934
S-So you seriously feel that way?
You need to be more realistic!

00:34.934 --> 00:37.303
- There's no way a guy like that exists!
- There's no way a guy like that exists!

00:37.303 --> 00:42.742
I know... But I've always
dreamed about it since I was little.

00:42.742 --> 00:46.012
One day this prince would appear
in front of the princess like a breeze

00:46.012 --> 00:49.382
and risk his own life to protect her...

00:49.382 --> 00:53.586
Maybe he only exists in the book,

00:53.586 --> 00:57.223
but in order to protect
the princess that he loves,

00:57.223 --> 01:00.060
he would face any enemy bravely

01:00.060 --> 01:04.326
and fight them so he could
protect her and his own dream!

01:10.670 --> 01:14.374
Huh? Did this cake
come with a hard candy?

01:14.374 --> 01:16.709
I wouldn't know because
I've never ordered that before.

01:16.709 --> 01:18.945
Maybe that's some kind of new service!

01:18.945 --> 01:21.347
Because it's been rumored
that a cake shop

01:21.347 --> 01:23.616
that's much better than this place
will open by the train station!

01:23.616 --> 01:28.188
The new place will steal their customers
unless they step up with their service!

01:28.188 --> 01:30.924
I see! This must be a part
of their new service then!

01:30.924 --> 01:32.118
- Is it good?
- Is it good?

01:33.726 --> 01:37.457
Hmm, this candy... I mean,
I don't think it's even edible.

01:40.433 --> 01:42.060
What? What?

01:50.443 --> 01:51.678
What's going on?!

01:51.678 --> 01:54.280
Don't worry, we are on your side!

01:54.280 --> 01:55.215
"We"?

01:55.215 --> 01:57.809
That's right! We are!

01:58.751 --> 01:59.752
Ready, Zero?

01:59.752 --> 02:02.422
- Yeah! I'm good to go!
- Huh?

02:02.422 --> 02:04.858
Don't worry, we're not going
to get you mixed up in this.

02:04.858 --> 02:07.327
We will protect you here!

02:07.327 --> 02:08.795
"Protect"?

02:08.795 --> 02:10.330
Me?

02:10.330 --> 02:11.631
Defense magic!

02:11.631 --> 02:12.962
Crystal barrier!

02:16.836 --> 02:21.875
Are these guys
protecting me by any chance?

02:21.875 --> 02:26.045
Just like that prince in the book,
who protects the princess...

02:26.045 --> 02:29.349
Just like that prince,
who defended his dream till the end...

02:29.349 --> 02:34.446
They... These princes who fell
from the sky are protecting me!

02:36.122 --> 02:48.535
One love! Two love? Three love! Four love?
One love! Two love? Three love! Come on!

02:48.535 --> 02:54.908
Here's what boys don't know.
Girls are moody.

02:54.908 --> 03:01.114
You're a sweet person
and it will be okay tomorrow.

03:01.114 --> 03:07.353
But I feel different today.
I want to go all out!

03:07.353 --> 03:13.660
Because I can't decide it just yet
I want everything

03:13.660 --> 03:19.966
The kinds of love are just like jewels.

03:19.966 --> 03:26.239
Each of them (Shining boys!)
is sparkling. Yes!

03:26.239 --> 03:32.512
They say there is only one true love

03:32.512 --> 03:38.718
But it's okay, we can decide that
at the very last moment

03:38.718 --> 03:45.024
That moment (Happiness)
I will protect it (Happiness)

03:45.024 --> 03:51.331
Come on, let's go find a poppin' heart

03:51.331 --> 03:57.537
My love! True love! Your love! Pure love!
My love! True love! Your love! Pure love!

03:57.537 --> 04:02.338
My love! True love! Your love!
Pure love! My love! True love!

04:06.346 --> 04:10.942
"The Princes Who Fell From The Sky!?"

04:12.018 --> 04:15.021
Looks like they're not
coming this way anymore.

04:15.021 --> 04:19.826
But are you sure it's in this area?
They're looking for it over there.

04:19.826 --> 04:21.594
That's impossible-zura!

04:21.594 --> 04:26.065
We, the Sea Horse tribe,
admire the Crystal Pearl!

04:26.065 --> 04:28.768
I know exactly where to find it even
without that raggedy-looking finder zura!

04:28.768 --> 04:29.936
It's called an intuition, right?

04:29.936 --> 04:31.738
Then tell me where it is zura.

04:31.738 --> 04:35.775
Even Zero's finder has been
saying it is here zura!

04:35.775 --> 04:38.711
You say it's here, but...

04:38.711 --> 04:40.413
Oops, they looked this way.

04:40.413 --> 04:41.675
I don't see anything.

04:43.416 --> 04:44.440
- What?
- What?

04:46.953 --> 04:48.021
What?

04:48.021 --> 04:49.389
What?!

04:49.389 --> 04:50.356
- Huh?
- Huh?

04:50.356 --> 04:51.190
No way!

04:51.190 --> 04:54.460
Hey, you! You don't happen to know
this pearl-like thing, do you?

04:54.460 --> 04:58.031
Well, I do. It came with
my cake earlier, so...

04:58.031 --> 04:59.832
What?!

04:59.832 --> 05:01.501
S-So what did you do with that?

05:01.501 --> 05:04.337
I thought it was a hard candy,
so I ate it.

05:04.337 --> 05:05.171
What?

05:05.171 --> 05:07.640
Don't give me that crap! Give it back!
Spit it out right here right now!

05:07.640 --> 05:09.301
Spit it! Give it back!

05:10.376 --> 05:11.144
Stop it!

05:11.144 --> 05:12.545
But she...

05:12.545 --> 05:15.848
Yeah, but she swallowed it.
There's nothing you can do about that.

05:15.848 --> 05:17.350
Just calm down a little, will ya?

05:17.350 --> 05:19.952
If you get loud right now
you'll draw others' attentions.

05:19.952 --> 05:22.221
But it's the Crystal Peal
we're talking about!

05:22.221 --> 05:25.058
How are we supposed to
become pros without it now?

05:25.058 --> 05:27.126
I understand how you feel, Zero, but...

05:27.126 --> 05:29.095
What's that?

05:29.095 --> 05:32.365
San! Forte! You guys are still here!

05:32.365 --> 05:35.768
What about you? What are you doing
with those humans anyway?

05:35.768 --> 05:40.073
Maybe you've found a clue
about the Crystal Pearl?

05:40.073 --> 05:43.209
Oh, this is what
that thing looks like, right?

05:43.209 --> 05:44.010
- You!
- You!

05:44.010 --> 05:46.479
Oh? So you do know about it?

05:46.479 --> 05:47.880
Nah, it's just...

05:47.880 --> 05:49.549
There's no way she does zura!

05:49.549 --> 05:54.153
No one knows that she has
the Crystal Pearl zura!

05:54.153 --> 05:55.154
Zura, why you...

05:55.154 --> 05:57.790
Oh, is that so?

05:57.790 --> 06:02.929
But something seems fishy. It looks like
everyone's hiding something from us...

06:02.929 --> 06:04.997
I think so, too!

06:04.997 --> 06:06.733
It looks that way, but...

06:06.733 --> 06:08.201
It looks that way, but...

06:08.201 --> 06:09.769
Let's go!

06:09.769 --> 06:11.270
Hey! That's very suspicious!

06:11.270 --> 06:14.207
- Nina!
- Nina!
- Suspicious!

06:14.207 --> 06:16.642
So you do know something, don't you?

06:16.642 --> 06:19.879
You must know where the
Crystal Pearl is or something like that!

06:19.879 --> 06:22.682
All of you! Hey! I said you!

06:22.682 --> 06:23.706
Shut up!

06:24.884 --> 06:28.254
Hang on! Don't get thrown off!

06:28.254 --> 06:30.990
Hey! So you do know something, don't you?

06:30.990 --> 06:35.228
Tell us what it is! Tell us
where the Crystal Pearl is!

06:35.228 --> 06:36.593
- Hey!
- Hell, if I know!

06:37.830 --> 06:39.866
Hey! Tell us!

06:39.866 --> 06:43.199
Go faster, Ichii!
They're going to catch us!

06:45.371 --> 06:47.896
I said hey! Ichii!

06:50.710 --> 06:52.645
Even I wouldn't fall for the
same trick three times!

06:52.645 --> 06:55.443
- Three times...
- Um, Fo-chan, ahead of you...

06:58.050 --> 07:02.043
Damn it... Roads inside
the city are hard to maneuver...

07:06.325 --> 07:09.954
I'm going to make you pay for this...
Zero... Ichii...

07:15.368 --> 07:19.305
We can stop here now.
You can get out. It's okay.

07:19.305 --> 07:21.307
It was unbelievably easy
to shake them off, wasn't it?

07:21.307 --> 07:26.643
Hey! How long... How long are you planning
to cling on to me like that, you letch!

07:32.452 --> 07:34.353
What did you do that for?!

07:34.353 --> 07:38.658
That's my line! Who the heck
are you two anyway?!

07:38.658 --> 07:39.926
Is it okay to tell her?

07:39.926 --> 07:40.860
Zura!

07:40.860 --> 07:43.162
Well, I guess we have
no choice in this case.

07:43.162 --> 07:45.198
I'll get right to the point then.

07:45.198 --> 07:48.868
We don't live in this world.
In other words we are not humans.

07:48.868 --> 07:49.702
Huh?

07:49.702 --> 07:51.204
We are sorcerers.

07:51.204 --> 07:53.506
S-Sorcerers?!

07:53.506 --> 07:54.340
- Yup.
- Yup.
- Yup.

07:54.340 --> 08:00.480
Sorcerers... You mean the ones
who fly around in the sky on the broom?

08:00.480 --> 08:01.614
- Yup.
- Yup.
- Yup.

08:01.614 --> 08:04.784
Phew, that's a relief. So you know
exactly what we're talking about then.

08:04.784 --> 08:06.752
I was totally thinking that...

08:06.752 --> 08:08.617
Yeah right!!

08:09.922 --> 08:11.290
Don't make a fool out of me!

08:11.290 --> 08:14.594
Do you actually think such a
simple trick would work on me?!

08:14.594 --> 08:16.629
What an inadaptable person you are...

08:16.629 --> 08:19.532
I thought she would believe us
since she saw that earlier, but...

08:19.532 --> 08:22.535
Now tell me! Just who are you guys?

08:22.535 --> 08:24.303
Like I said, we're sorcerers.

08:24.303 --> 08:29.008
Right now we're taking the test to become
professional sorcerers in the magic world.

08:29.008 --> 08:31.978
Basically we're taking the sorcery test.

08:31.978 --> 08:36.082
Every year the examinees
would pair up and take the test.

08:36.082 --> 08:38.417
Here's how the test works.

08:38.417 --> 08:41.988
They'd drop a ball, which is called the
Crystal Pearl somewhere in the human world.

08:41.988 --> 08:45.157
Only the one team that manages
to find it by Christmas,

08:45.157 --> 08:47.593
which is the time the test ends,
will pass the test.

08:47.593 --> 08:49.562
Then they will become pros.

08:49.562 --> 08:52.365
Okay, then where's that
Crystal Pearl now?

08:52.365 --> 08:53.432
Where, you said?!

08:53.432 --> 08:56.636
You ate it earlier! You ate it earlier!!

08:56.636 --> 09:00.239
So you're saying that the hard candy,
which came with the cake, was in fact...

09:00.239 --> 09:01.340
That's right!

09:01.340 --> 09:05.878
That is... That is the Crystal Pearl!

09:05.878 --> 09:09.115
What?! So that means...
You guys are sorcerers?!

09:09.115 --> 09:10.983
That's what we've been
telling you the whole time!

09:10.983 --> 09:15.922
Does that mean I'm going to be targeted
by the sorcerer examinees from now on?!

09:15.922 --> 09:17.456
- She finally got it...
- She finally got it...
- She finally got it zura...

09:17.456 --> 09:19.625
No way! You need to
do something about that!

09:19.625 --> 09:21.694
First of all how could it be even a test

09:21.694 --> 09:24.130
when that Crystal whatever thing
is inside my body?!

09:24.130 --> 09:25.031
Exactly!

09:25.031 --> 09:27.600
All right, let me call
the headquarters real quick.

09:27.600 --> 09:30.369
Moron! This is all because you ate it!

09:30.369 --> 09:32.004
What did you say?

09:32.004 --> 09:35.308
Hello, is this Magic Academy,
the test headquarters?

09:35.308 --> 09:37.743
Well, the thing is...

09:37.743 --> 09:40.446
Hmm? Is that what happened?

09:40.446 --> 09:44.883
But the Crystal Pearl isn't meant
to be inside the body to begin with...

09:46.085 --> 09:49.088
In order to remove it
you need a new medicine,

09:49.088 --> 09:52.391
but the medicine won't be ready
until Christmas at the earliest...

09:52.391 --> 09:56.429
Just cancel the test please!
Or have a new pearl for the test or...

09:56.429 --> 09:57.555
That's impossible.

09:58.998 --> 10:02.735
What do I do? What did
I do to deserve this?

10:02.735 --> 10:05.471
Don't cry! I'm the one who wants to cry!

10:05.471 --> 10:08.207
We were finally ready to take the test!

10:08.207 --> 10:11.677
That was the opportunity to get
closer to Jeff, but it's over already!

10:11.677 --> 10:14.680
Am I going to stay as a student
for another year?! Damn it!

10:14.680 --> 10:16.349
I don't want to give up!

10:16.349 --> 10:18.618
I don't want to throw away the dream
that I was determined to achieve!

10:18.618 --> 10:21.887
If that's the case, I guess you have
no choice but to prepare yourself, Zero.

10:21.887 --> 10:22.989
Huh?

10:22.989 --> 10:24.924
There is only one way to do this.

10:24.924 --> 10:27.326
You will have to protect her
with everything you've got

10:27.326 --> 10:28.761
until the day that the test ends.

10:28.761 --> 10:31.430
Until the day the medicine is completed

10:31.430 --> 10:33.733
and you're able to remove
the Crystal Pearl from her body...

10:33.733 --> 10:35.768
We will protect her with our own hands!

10:35.768 --> 10:37.069
You mean her?!

10:37.069 --> 10:41.374
Me? These guys are going to protect me?

10:41.374 --> 10:43.709
What is your name?

10:43.709 --> 10:44.877
Nina.

10:44.877 --> 10:47.846
I'm Ichii, and he is Zero.

10:48.714 --> 10:52.284
All right, Ichii...
We don't want to give it up, right?

10:52.284 --> 10:54.787
We don't want to get discouraged
over stuff like this, right?

10:54.787 --> 10:57.289
That's right!
We'll just have to protect it!

10:57.289 --> 11:00.393
With everything we've got,
we will have to protect Nina

11:00.393 --> 11:03.663
and the pearl inside her
until the test is over!

11:03.663 --> 11:05.460
I knew it!

11:06.565 --> 11:09.001
That's why you took her earlier and...

11:09.001 --> 11:10.836
Hey, you're the people from earlier!

11:10.836 --> 11:14.874
Examinees #003 and #004! San and...

11:14.874 --> 11:16.933
- Forte!
- That's us!

11:18.878 --> 11:21.447
I see! That's what happened!

11:21.447 --> 11:23.549
I knew you were acting strange.

11:23.549 --> 11:26.085
Who would've thought there's
the Crystal Pearl inside her?

11:26.085 --> 11:27.586
Now hand it over to us.

11:27.586 --> 11:28.754
Give me a break!

11:28.754 --> 11:31.223
She's already ours!

11:31.223 --> 11:33.192
Who would give her to you?

11:33.192 --> 11:37.263
Then I guess it's my turn to
take action, huh? Here I come!

11:37.263 --> 11:38.931
Summoning magic!

11:38.931 --> 11:42.702
I shall make a special
summoning of Step Cat!

11:42.702 --> 11:46.297
Humph, a stupid cat! I'll use
my destruction magic and...

11:49.308 --> 11:51.010
What did you do that for, Ichii?!

11:51.010 --> 11:52.445
You can't do that!

11:52.445 --> 11:55.347
When you go crazy you end up
breaking everything around you, so, no!

11:55.347 --> 11:57.183
But I will go easy on them!

11:57.183 --> 11:59.651
More importantly, it's coming!

12:01.053 --> 12:02.722
Wow, it's so cute!

12:02.722 --> 12:04.924
Hey, Nina! What are you talking about?

12:04.924 --> 12:06.392
It's going to catch up with us zura!

12:06.392 --> 12:09.195
Zero, you take Nina-chan
and get out of here quick!

12:09.195 --> 12:12.598
I'll use my defense magic and get
through here for the time being!

12:12.598 --> 12:13.632
Go!

12:13.632 --> 12:16.068
Huh? A blowfish?

12:16.068 --> 12:17.803
I'm not a blowfish! I'm a sea horse!

12:17.803 --> 12:19.138
I'm going to fall!

12:19.138 --> 12:22.274
Shut up! Just hold still,
otherwise I'm really going to drop you!

12:22.274 --> 12:24.610
First of all,
you're giving us enough trouble!

12:24.610 --> 12:27.480
Because of you we were forced
to run away from them!

12:27.480 --> 12:31.250
Zero is in a bad mood because
he didn't get to fight them zura!

12:31.250 --> 12:32.218
Don't say that!

12:32.218 --> 12:34.920
Then that's fine! Just let me go already!

12:34.920 --> 12:38.157
I don't want to be protected by someone
who thinks I'm causing trouble!

12:38.157 --> 12:41.560
- Let me go! Let me go! Let me go!
- Hey, what are you doing, Nina?

12:41.560 --> 12:43.824
I'm going to fall! I'm going to fall!
I'm really going to fall!

12:47.032 --> 12:50.236
No way! We're a little
too close to each other!

12:50.236 --> 12:53.405
Oh, no! My heart is beating so fast!

12:53.405 --> 12:55.207
- This is not good!
- You...

12:55.207 --> 12:56.308
Huh?!

12:56.308 --> 12:59.744
You have... no boobs.

13:08.020 --> 13:10.856
Jerk! What the heck is wrong with him?!

13:10.856 --> 13:16.529
He said he was going to protect me first,
but now he tells me I'm in his way!

13:16.529 --> 13:17.596
I was stupid for taking him seriously

13:17.596 --> 13:19.098
and getting excited about it
even just a little bit!

13:19.098 --> 13:21.600
Then do you want to join us?

13:21.600 --> 13:23.035
What?

13:23.035 --> 13:24.036
What?!

13:24.036 --> 13:26.129
It's best if you don't move.

13:27.273 --> 13:29.842
You're the one from earlier...

13:29.842 --> 13:31.410
I found you!

13:31.410 --> 13:33.605
I didn't know you were
at a place like this.

13:52.031 --> 13:55.159
Nina! Nina! Nina!

13:56.402 --> 13:58.204
That was easy.

13:58.204 --> 14:01.774
It was all thanks to me!
Where's my reward?

14:01.774 --> 14:06.212
To tell you the truth I don't
want to hurt a cute girl like you.

14:06.212 --> 14:08.314
Hey, where is my reward?

14:08.314 --> 14:10.416
B-But I guess I have no choice, right?

14:10.416 --> 14:12.484
Because there's the
Crystal Pearl in your body...

14:12.484 --> 14:13.986
Tagano's tart!

14:13.986 --> 14:16.589
- So, you should go ahead
and surrender yourself...
- Bujiya's cream puffs!

14:16.589 --> 14:17.590
- And become... Our prey and...
- Pastela's pudding!

14:17.590 --> 14:20.252
- And become... Our prey and...
- Gozy Goner's strawberry shortcake!

14:23.729 --> 14:26.699
O-Okay, I got it! Just take this and go
buy whatever you want! Whatever you want!

14:26.699 --> 14:28.067
Are you trying to kill me or what?

14:28.067 --> 14:30.803
Yay! Fo-chan, thank you!

14:30.803 --> 14:34.034
Bring back the change!
And be sure to get the receipts!

14:36.275 --> 14:42.839
I can't take this anymore...
Why is she my partner?

14:44.683 --> 14:46.051
Hang in there.

14:46.051 --> 14:49.455
If you hang in there and keep going
I'm sure something good will happen to you.

14:49.455 --> 14:50.055
Okay?

14:50.055 --> 14:51.490
Don't you try to cheer me up!

14:51.490 --> 14:55.790
Fo-chan, I've bought some cakes!
I spent all the money!

14:59.198 --> 15:01.291
Nina! Nina!

15:02.201 --> 15:03.836
It's delicious!

15:03.836 --> 15:05.704
This one's good too!

15:05.704 --> 15:07.439
Wanna try this one too?

15:07.439 --> 15:09.308
- Ah!
- Ah!

15:09.308 --> 15:10.509
It's so good!

15:10.509 --> 15:11.877
Yes! So good!

15:11.877 --> 15:14.046
It's scrumptious!

15:14.046 --> 15:15.347
What's up with those two...

15:15.347 --> 15:18.339
First of all they bought them with
my money. So why can't they be like...

15:19.151 --> 15:21.020
- Here you go, Fo-chan!
- Here you go, Fo-chan!

15:21.020 --> 15:22.009
Or...

15:23.188 --> 15:24.490
- Do you want to eat them, Fo-chan?
- Do you want to eat them, Fo-chan?

15:24.490 --> 15:25.991
Like that...

15:25.991 --> 15:27.359
At all?!

15:27.359 --> 15:29.194
Do you want some then, Fo-chan?

15:29.194 --> 15:31.196
No thanks!

15:31.196 --> 15:32.865
You're so uptight...

15:32.865 --> 15:36.669
Of course I am! What do you
think you're going to do now, San?

15:36.669 --> 15:39.772
Yeah, she might have
swallowed the Crystal Pearl,

15:39.772 --> 15:41.407
but I absolutely refuse
to protect a girl like her

15:41.407 --> 15:43.042
just like Zero or Ichii said they would!

15:43.042 --> 15:44.777
The way you said it just pissed me off!

15:44.777 --> 15:46.545
Hey, if that's how you feel,

15:46.545 --> 15:49.982
why don't you do whatever it takes to
remove the Crystal Pearl from her body?

15:49.982 --> 15:51.650
What?!

15:51.650 --> 15:53.118
What?!

15:53.118 --> 15:54.353
I see.

15:54.353 --> 15:55.955
It makes sense, right?

15:55.955 --> 16:00.025
There's no rule that you can't
hurt humans in the sorcery test.

16:00.025 --> 16:04.496
So it doesn't matter what happens to her
as long as we can retrieve the pearl.

16:04.496 --> 16:06.732
Hey, hey! Tell me
you're kidding, San-chan!

16:06.732 --> 16:09.168
Remember, we just ate the cakes together?

16:09.168 --> 16:10.369
This can't be happening!

16:10.369 --> 16:13.005
- Now that you mention it,
we could do that, couldn't we?
- What?!

16:13.005 --> 16:16.775
Leave this human aside, we'll just
have to take only the pearl, right?

16:16.775 --> 16:17.943
What?

16:17.943 --> 16:19.812
F-Forte...

16:19.812 --> 16:20.801
Nina.

16:21.814 --> 16:24.483
Those cakes were delicious, weren't they?

16:24.483 --> 16:27.119
San-chan?! San-chan...

16:27.119 --> 16:29.021
Nina! Nina!

16:29.021 --> 16:32.658
This is bad... Who knows what those two
would do to her if they find her...

16:32.658 --> 16:34.226
It's Zero's fault zura!

16:34.226 --> 16:35.861
I understand you were in a bad mood,

16:35.861 --> 16:37.363
but you didn't have to tell her
that she was in your way!

16:37.363 --> 16:40.799
Shut up! We're going
to find Nina no matter what!

16:40.799 --> 16:42.735
But how zura?

16:42.735 --> 16:46.105
Now that neither the finder's signal
or my intuition is working...

16:46.105 --> 16:50.075
How can we possibly find San and Forte
in such a big town like this zura?

16:50.075 --> 16:51.143
I get it!

16:51.143 --> 16:54.046
If we have to find a place where
San and Forte would go, not Nina...

16:54.046 --> 16:57.846
I know where it is!
The place they would go is...

17:01.520 --> 17:04.455
Are you guys serious about this,
San and Forte?

17:06.091 --> 17:07.285
Forte...

17:10.195 --> 17:17.536
This is magic. I can control everything
with the sound that this flute creates.

17:17.536 --> 17:19.004
It's my hypnosis magic.

17:19.004 --> 17:21.573
N-No...

17:21.573 --> 17:25.844
I can't even talk...
I can barely breathe!

17:25.844 --> 17:29.211
At this rate I will...
At this rate I will...

17:30.716 --> 17:34.319
It's all right. She's just a human.

17:34.319 --> 17:36.455
That's right. She's just a human.

17:36.455 --> 17:40.225
No! I don't want to die!
Even just humans...

17:40.225 --> 17:42.561
Even just animals
are still living beings!

17:42.561 --> 17:44.763
I can't believe
I'm going to die over this...

17:44.763 --> 17:47.266
I won't let that happen!

17:47.266 --> 17:48.167
- We will...
- We will...

17:48.167 --> 17:52.471
No matter what happens we will protect you!
We will defend our dream!

17:52.471 --> 17:56.601
Because that is my dream! That's the dream
that I've determined to achieve!

17:57.543 --> 17:58.944
Zero...

17:58.944 --> 18:00.913
- So have faith in us,
- So have faith in us,

18:00.913 --> 18:04.650
- because we will protect you at any time!
- because we will protect you at any time!

18:04.650 --> 18:09.087
Zero! Ichii! Help me! Help me!

18:10.255 --> 18:15.260
Bingo! I knew that the place San and Forte
would go has to be... Right there!

18:15.260 --> 18:16.227
Zero...

18:17.296 --> 18:20.129
Nina! Nina!

18:26.872 --> 18:28.807
I knew it was here!

18:28.807 --> 18:30.365
Zero! Ichii!

18:31.310 --> 18:33.445
Sorry to have kept you waiting, Nina!

18:33.445 --> 18:38.350
Fo-chan, didn't your mom tell you not
to steal other people's belongings?

18:38.350 --> 18:41.753
You moron! Whoever takes it wins!
That's the rule!

18:41.753 --> 18:44.790
In other words, right now
the Crystal Pearl belongs to us!

18:44.790 --> 18:46.792
Therefore we have no business with you!

18:46.792 --> 18:48.227
Flames, come forth!

18:48.227 --> 18:52.831
Burn down the girl's body
and remove the Crystal Pearl from it!

18:52.831 --> 18:55.334
- We won't let you!
- We won't let you!

18:55.334 --> 18:57.996
Defense magic! Crystal!

19:00.572 --> 19:02.403
Zero! Ichii!

19:04.042 --> 19:06.311
I wonder how much longer
they can take this.

19:06.311 --> 19:10.645
It might be just hypnosis, but once
they're hypnotized it's pretty effective.

19:13.285 --> 19:15.053
Oh, no! It's going to kill you!

19:15.053 --> 19:18.023
At this rate it's going to kill
both of you, too, not just me!

19:18.023 --> 19:22.127
Stop it! Just forget about it! I want
both of you to get out of here at least!

19:22.127 --> 19:23.862
No, they'll be okay zura.

19:23.862 --> 19:24.997
But still!

19:24.997 --> 19:29.234
Zero and Ichii won't lose.
Zero and Ichii will never give up zura!

19:29.234 --> 19:31.770
Because they have a dream zura!

19:31.770 --> 19:33.795
We have someone that we need to repay!

19:34.540 --> 19:37.109
That's right! Just like we're
doing this for you right now,

19:37.109 --> 19:39.945
this person protected me, too!

19:39.945 --> 19:43.916
Even when I was discouraged...
Even when I couldn't pull myself together,

19:43.916 --> 19:47.352
this person was always watching over me!

19:47.352 --> 19:51.757
And I want to be like him!
He always gave me a helping hand!

19:51.757 --> 19:54.626
I want to be a professional
just like Jeff!

19:54.626 --> 19:56.595
Because I want to do the same thing

19:56.595 --> 19:58.564
that he's done for me to
as many people as possible!

19:58.564 --> 20:00.299
Damn it!

20:00.299 --> 20:02.534
You don't have that kind of person zura?

20:02.534 --> 20:07.105
The person you want to protect...
The person who protected you before...

20:07.105 --> 20:09.741
If you do have one,
you must not give up on anything

20:09.741 --> 20:11.243
for the sake of the person zura!

20:11.243 --> 20:13.845
Because the person must've been
continuing to protect you

20:13.845 --> 20:18.417
with all the courage he or she has!

20:18.417 --> 20:20.817
Dad... Mom...

20:21.920 --> 20:24.690
That's right.
Whenever I hurt myself or got sick...

20:24.690 --> 20:27.059
They were always much
more worried about me

20:27.059 --> 20:31.230
than they'd ever worry about themselves...

20:31.230 --> 20:33.699
Please! Help Nina! Help my daughter!

20:33.699 --> 20:36.395
- She's our precious daughter!
- They were always protecting me.

20:37.769 --> 20:42.407
But even your father and mother
weren't strong from the beginning zura.

20:42.407 --> 20:46.278
You were born,
but they didn't know anything...

20:46.278 --> 20:49.214
They gradually became stronger as
they learned from their mistakes zura.

20:49.214 --> 20:53.986
They made mistakes...
They got scolded, but still...

20:53.986 --> 20:55.988
It's all because they love you, Nina.

20:55.988 --> 20:59.191
They're holding on
with all their might zura.

20:59.191 --> 21:02.894
Because they want to protect
what they love by doing whatever it takes!

21:02.894 --> 21:05.764
At least what's precious to them!

21:05.764 --> 21:07.499
Zero! Ichii!

21:07.499 --> 21:12.604
They will never lose zura because
they have what they must protect zura!

21:12.604 --> 21:16.074
They have a dream that
they'd never ever give up on!

21:16.074 --> 21:17.542
So...

21:17.542 --> 21:19.444
So they'll never lose no matter what!

21:19.444 --> 21:21.580
To defend my dream!

21:21.580 --> 21:23.878
- To protect the ones who're dear to us!
- To protect the ones who're dear to us!
- To protect the ones who're dear to us!

21:40.832 --> 21:42.629
Destruction magic!

21:50.976 --> 21:54.139
Magic cannon!

22:02.187 --> 22:04.389
Zero! Ichii! You're going to pay for this!

22:04.389 --> 22:08.587
Nina-chan, let's eat cakes
together again, okay?!

22:10.529 --> 22:15.400
Shut up! Come back next year!
If we're still here, that is!

22:15.400 --> 22:17.502
Um...

22:17.502 --> 22:22.708
Thank you! You guys worked
really hard to protect me

22:22.708 --> 22:27.145
but I said some horrible things
to both of you...

22:27.145 --> 22:28.914
So I'm really sorry!

22:28.914 --> 22:30.882
Don't worry about it, Nina-chan.

22:30.882 --> 22:35.354
Remember, I told you that we'll
protect you no matter what happens...

22:35.354 --> 22:37.689
With everything we've got...

22:37.689 --> 22:40.292
We will protect you, Nina!

22:40.292 --> 22:43.128
So they are my ideal guys?!

22:43.128 --> 22:46.231
No matter how ferocious the enemies may be,
they'd bravely face them and fight them

22:46.231 --> 22:50.035
for the people that they love
and their own dreams!

22:50.035 --> 22:52.537
These guys are...

22:52.537 --> 22:54.106
These guys are...

22:54.106 --> 22:58.977
My... My... Princes!

22:58.977 --> 23:01.747
But we'd appreciate it if you stop
acting on your own from now on!

23:01.747 --> 23:04.282
That's right! Whether you like it or not

23:04.282 --> 23:07.018
you'll have to stay with us
until the test is over!

23:07.018 --> 23:08.687
Don't be pulling our legs, all right?

23:08.687 --> 23:14.025
Wh-Why do you have to say it like that?
You don't have to tell me that! I hate you!

23:14.025 --> 23:17.028
You have no sensitivity whatsoever!

23:17.028 --> 23:21.867
So anyway, these are the guys
who're going to protect me,

23:21.867 --> 23:25.737
they'll protect me until the test is over.

23:25.737 --> 23:28.740
But most likely the road ahead
will be bumpy for sure.

23:28.740 --> 23:31.176
What's going to happen to my life now?

23:31.176 --> 23:34.168
Hey, quit it! Help me!

23:35.447 --> 23:37.972
Looks like it's going to be a pain

23:44.389 --> 23:47.325
Pit-a-pat, skip! Parallel pop!

23:47.325 --> 23:50.195
Pit-a-pat, step! Miracle kiss!

23:50.195 --> 23:53.096
Pit-a-pat, magical! Lollipop!

24:02.007 --> 24:07.779
My heart is beating so fast.
He might notice.

24:07.779 --> 24:13.585
My heart is pounding and throbbing.
It feels like it's going to burst.

24:13.585 --> 24:19.458
No matter which direction I look,
his eyes are crystals.

24:19.458 --> 24:25.297
They are so brilliant
that I just look away.

24:25.297 --> 24:31.203
The seed of love has begun to sprout.
Even my magic, too! Check it out!

24:31.203 --> 24:39.411
They will keep on growing
and spinning and explode!

24:39.411 --> 24:45.383
Popping lollipop. Save me, lollipop!
Throbbing heart.

24:45.383 --> 24:51.623
Two candies, I can't decide
which one is better.

24:51.623 --> 24:57.529
Even the earth turns the other way,
if you hold me,

24:57.529 --> 25:03.368
the shape of my heart will
change just like pit-a-pat!

25:03.368 --> 25:08.965
The shape of my heart will change
just like pit-a-pat! Lollipop!

25:11.710 --> 25:13.879
I accidentally swallowed
the Crystal Pearl.

25:13.879 --> 25:14.946
Now I'm in big trouble,

25:14.946 --> 25:17.015
being chased by the sorcerer examinees
from the magic world.

25:17.015 --> 25:19.584
Don't worry because
we will protect you, Nina!

25:19.584 --> 25:22.153
Hey, what are you two doing in my school?!

25:22.153 --> 25:24.289
You two are going to be around me even
when I eat lunch or change my clothes!

25:24.289 --> 25:26.691
And on top of that, you two are going to be
sitting right next to me in class?!

25:26.691 --> 25:29.261
Boo-hoo! Everyone's stare is piercing me!

25:29.261 --> 25:34.032
What do you expect? San and Forte have
infiltrated your school to get you!

25:34.032 --> 25:37.402
Next episode on Save Me! Lollipop!
"Abruptly, May We Join You?!"

25:37.402 --> 25:38.637
Promise you'll watch it, okay!

25:38.637 --> 25:40.867
If you don't you'll get bitten by Zura!
